From 408df48a72820a8d68d33e9dcf578b925898943b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Delaram Talaashrafi <dtalaashrafi@nvidia.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:26:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] [MLIR][OpenACC] Add acc-emit-remarks-loop pass (#205203)

Add a function-level pass that emits optimization remarks for loops in
`acc.compute_region`, describing their mapping to OpenACC parallel
levels (gang, worker, vector, sequential) and GPU dimensions (blockIdx,
threadIdx).
